  ==============================================
   KickOS 0.5.1  -  microkernel RTOS
  ==============================================
   board   microbit
   arch    armv6m
   cpu     nrf51822
   mpu     off
   sched   tickless

[ringpriv]   CONTROL=0x0
[ringpriv] ok - CONTROL.nPRIV=0: no privilege axis, the unprivileged thread is PRIVILEGED
[ringpriv] skip - the boundary arm needs a privilege ring: nothing here to escape from
[ringpriv] PASS (1 arms)
